cases\nNew requirement ids are created in P0 and are not in the store yet: FR/TR/TEST-MCP-SESSIONTURN-*, -SESSIONCLASS-*, -SESSIONREVIEW-*, and FR-SUPPORT-016, TR-SUPPORT-CORE-016, TEST-SUPPORT-023 (legacy source citation FR-SUPPORT-010G, renamed in S4); FR/TR arrays on this TODO stay empty until then\nPLAN_NONEMPTY=523 DESC_NONEMPTY=523\nDIFF_COUNT=0\nTASK_FIRST={\"task\":\"Operator approval of this plan (required before any step, including P0)\",\"done\":false}\nTASK_LAST={\"task\":\"S11 Documentation and exit gates; HV-B by Codex gpt-6-sol xhigh (AGREE >= 98/98)\",\"done\":false}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
